OL,5,G2200 Battlefront: WWII Road to Victory
OL,6,     FBefore the Pearl Harbor attack,
OL,7,     FJapan opened the Pacific War by
OL,8,     Fstriking British forces in Malaya.
OL,9,     FTheir route led them into
OL,10,     FSingapore - the world's most armed
OL,11,     Ffortress.
OL,12,G2230 Battlefront: WWII Road to Victory
OL,13,     FDuring a surprise attack on the
OL,14,     FU.S. Pacific fleet at Pearl
OL,15,     FHarbor, Japanese navy pilots score
OL,16,     Fa near-total victory. An American
OL,17,     Fgunner and a Japanese airman
OL,18,     Fdescribe their experiences.
