OL,5,G2300 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FWhile Karen remains in a critical
OL,7,     Fcondition in hospital, at
OL,8,     FWentworth Ros is assigned to share
OL,9,     Fa room with Kath - but before long
OL,10,     Fone of the cellmates lies
OL,11,     Fcollapsed on the floor...
OL,12,G0005 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FKath pleads ignorance about Ros's
OL,14,     Fcondition, Meg meets Geoff for
OL,15,     Fdrinks, and the signal is given
OL,16,     Ffor an escape plan which has
OL,17,     Falready gone awry...
