OL,5,G0105 The Yorkshire Vet
OL,6,     FShona Searson prepares for her big
OL,7,     FYorkshire wedding - due to take
OL,8,     Fplace in her garden, surrounded by
OL,9,     Fher sheep, goats and dogs - as she
OL,10,     Fgoes from wellies to wedding
OL,11,     Fdress.
OL,12,G0200 The Yorkshire Vet
OL,13,     FPeter Wright rushes to help two
OL,14,     Fsisters whose heifer is struggling
OL,15,     Fto give birth. Rohin Aojula has a
OL,16,     Fbig problem with a little guinea
OL,17,     Fpig called Vader and he can't
OL,18,     Fsummon 'The Force'.
